			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 412109901,
					"content": "阿貝多先生的秘密一定很厲害吧，否則，為什麼要保密呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 4121002,
			"completionStepIds": [
				4121002
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_AUTO",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_AND",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"4121002",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 4121002,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"砂糖"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 412100201,
					"content": "呀，是砂糖！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100202,
					"content": "妳也來雪山探險嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100203,
					"content": "嗚哇！嚇我一跳…請不要在我思考研究報告的時候突然嚇唬我！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100204,
					"content": "可妳看上去只是呆呆地站著而已呀…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100205,
					"content": "沒、沒有這種事，我明明是在為新研發的四倍大種籽甜甜花取名。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100206,
						412100207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100206,
					"content": "四倍大種籽甜甜花一定好吃。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100208
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412100208,
					"content": "#哦哦？{F#妳}{M#你}感興趣嗎！太好了，下次請務必給我向{F#妳}{M#你}展示新成果的機會！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100209,
					"content": "好可惜，要不是來雪山，我一般都會把成品帶在身邊的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100210,
					"content": "對哦，你不是在城裡做研究嗎？怎麼跑到這裡來啦？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100211,
					"content": "我和蒂瑪烏斯在幫阿貝多先生整理實驗數據哦。蒂瑪烏斯剛走，你們沒遇到他嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100212,
					"content": "沒有欸。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100213,
					"content": "他說自己對數據不夠敏銳，比阿貝多先生差了太多。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100214,
					"content": "有些東西先生一眼就能看出來，我們卻要想很久。恐怕這就是學識與經驗的差距吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100215,
					"content": "因為沮喪，他就說要去別處散散步，我一個人先做剩餘的工作。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100216,
					"content": "（總覺得蒂瑪烏斯是不是故意的…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100217
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412100217,
					"content": "本想做完手上的事四處轉轉，沒想到從報告裡找到了一些有趣數據！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100218,
					"content": "唉…我的探秘之旅，又要延後了呀…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100219,
					"content": "探秘？什麼秘？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100220,
					"content": "啊…這麼說來，你們現在有空嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100221,
					"content": "有呀！我們正在到處閒逛呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100222
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100222,
					"content": "能請你們幫我一個忙嗎？事實上，我總覺得…阿貝多先生有事瞞著我和蒂瑪烏斯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100223
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100223,
					"content": "阿貝多不是你們的老師嗎？老師能有什麼事瞞著學生呀。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100224
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100224,
					"content": "是啊，可是他似乎一直在掩藏某件東西…我猜，一定是與煉金術有關的厲害東西！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100225
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100225,
					"content": "明明不知道實情，為什麼還能這麼肯定啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100226
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100226,
					"content": "因為我和蒂瑪烏斯都是煉金術的狂熱研究者，如果是別的東西，阿貝多先生沒必要瞞著我們才對。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100227
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100227,
					"content": "啊…這麼一說確實很有道理…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100228
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100228,
					"content": "能幫我調查一下阿貝多先生到底藏著什麼嗎？我實在是太好奇了！拜託拜託！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100229
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100229,
					"content": "#唔…{F#妳}{M#你}覺得呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100230,
						412100231
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100230,
					"content": "如果砂糖想知道，我可以一探究竟。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100232
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412100232,
					"content": "#哇啊——！太好了，謝謝{F#妳}{M#你}！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100233
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100233,
					"content": "好吧好吧，那就讓我們走一趟吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100231,
					"content": "我也想知道阿貝多的秘密收藏。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100232
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412100207,
					"content": "這是可以吃的東西嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100208
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 4121003,
			"completionStepIds": [
				4121004
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_AUTO",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"4121004",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 4121004,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"阿貝多"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 412100301,
					"content": "阿貝多——！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100302,
					"content": "嗨，又是我們哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100303
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412100303,
					"content": "嗯？你們怎麼回來了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100304,
					"content": "迷路了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100305,
					"content": "不是啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100306,
						412100307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100306,
					"content": "在路上接了砂糖的委託，來調查你的秘密。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100308
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412100308,
					"content": "哦？秘密？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100309,
					"content": "#啊啊啊，{F#妳}{M#你}在幹什麼呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100310,
					"content": "這種時候不是應該悄悄調查嗎？怎麼就說出來了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100311,
					"content": "反正也瞞不過阿貝多吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100312
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412100312,
					"content": "#嗚…就算{F#妳}{M#你}這麼說…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100313,
					"content": "#來得正好，我也有事要找{F#妳}{M#你}，旅行者。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100314,
					"content": "接著！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100315,
					"content": "咦，這是什麼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100316,
					"content": "如妳所見，一把單手劍。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100317,
						412100318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100317,
					"content": "原來你會鍛造？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100319
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412100319,
					"content": "劍不是我打的，不過，我剛才在上面施了煉金術。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100320,
					"content": "想試試嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100321,
					"content": "欸？要把它給我嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100322
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412100322,
					"content": "#根據我的研究，這把劍情況特殊，只有{F#妳}{M#你}能使用。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100323
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100323,
					"content": "#但我現在迫切需要它的數據，麻煩{F#妳}{M#你}拿著它多多戰鬥。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100324
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100324,
					"content": "喂喂，等一下，怎麼會有只給一個人使用的劍呀？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100325
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100325,
					"content": "該不會有什麼副作用吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100326
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412100326,
					"content": "很敏銳嘛。這把劍確實不同尋常，它受到了某種詛咒。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100327
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100327,
					"content": "#尋常人完全無法使用這把單手劍，但{F#妳}{M#你}不一樣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100328
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100328,
					"content": "哎…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100329
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100329,
					"content": "#可以說，這把被詛咒的劍唯獨對{F#妳}{M#你}沒有害處。既然如此，除了{F#妳}{M#你}我還能找誰幫忙呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100330
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100330,
					"content": "多說無益，到附近找幾隻怪物吧。有些事，一試便知。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100318,
					"content": "煉金術士也要兼職鐵匠嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100319
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412100307,
					"content": "砂糖說你有些不可告人的小秘密。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100308
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 4121004,
			"completionStepIds": [
				4121006
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_AUTO",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"4121006",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 4121006,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"凶惡的男人"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 412100401,
					"content": "找到了！就是那個小兔崽子拿著！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凶惡的男人"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100402,
					"content": "把東西交出來，小偷！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凶惡的男人"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100403,
					"content": "盜寶團？這麼冷的地方也會有盜寶團嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100404,
					"content": "少廢話！給我！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凶惡的男人"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100405,
					"content": "小心！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 4121005,
			"completionStepIds": [
				4121008
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_AUTO",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"4121008",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 4121008,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"阿貝多"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 412100501,
					"content": "盜寶團居然叫我們小偷，明明他們自己才是小偷！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100502,
					"content": "這些人來得可真快啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100503,
						412100504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100503,
					"content": "阿貝多，你是小偷嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100505
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412100505,
					"content": "怎麼可能。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100506,
					"content": "他們說的東西，好像就是這把劍，到底是怎麼回事呀？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100507,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}那是什麼表情？我當然不可能去偷劍了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100508,
					"content": "不久前，騎士團在蒙德城外抓捕了一批盜寶團，他們非法搬運的贓物也被全數收繳。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100509,
					"content": "這把劍就是其中之一。說是贓物，卻沒人認領，也不知從哪來的，一直丟在倉庫裡。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100510,
					"content": "我去倉庫拿東西的時候意外注意到了它。說真的，舊成這樣的劍除了拿來做煉金材料恐怕別無他用。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100511,
					"content": "噫，怎麼能把贓物說成是自己的東西呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100512,
					"content": "然後呢？你就把它拿走了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100513,
					"content": "嗯，我拿這把劍是想做實驗用，卻沒想到，在調查過程中發現了它的真實來歷。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100514
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100514,
					"content": "這把看似老舊的武器出自某位已故鐵匠之手，是傳說中的魔劍。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100515,
					"content": "魔劍？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100516
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100516,
					"content": "據說，鐵匠在鑄劍後不久便失蹤，劍也下落不明。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100517
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100517,
					"content": "根據贓物來源反推，它多半是被盜寶團偷走，由此失傳至今。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100518
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100518,
					"content": "啊！造劍的人失蹤了？！好可怕！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100519
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100519,
					"content": "怪不得是被詛咒的魔劍！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100520
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100520,
					"content": "沒錯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100521
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100521,
					"content": "人類竟然能造出這樣的魔劍…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100522
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412100522,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}知道關於<color=#00E1FFFF>「杜林」</color>和這座雪山的事嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100523
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100523,
					"content": "<color=#00E1FFFF>「杜林」</color>，就是數百年前<color=#00E1FFFF>「風神巴巴托斯」</color>與<color=#00E1FFFF>「特瓦林」</color>聯手擊敗的、威脅蒙德的黑龍。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100524
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100524,
					"content": "激戰最後，被打敗的杜林從空中墜落，跌入了茫茫白雪。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100525
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100525,
					"content": "雪山上的積雪終年不化，是一件非常奇妙的事。杜林落在這裡，究竟是偶然還是必然？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100526
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100526,
					"content": "還能是必然嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100527
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100527,
					"content": "選擇雪山作為墳場，說不定是想利用這種冰封一切的力量來抑制杜林身上的腐殖之毒。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100528
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100528,
					"content": "巴巴托斯那樣的神明，應該能想到這一辦法才對。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100529
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100529,
					"content": "哇…巴巴托斯那麼厲害的嗎…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100530
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100530,
					"content": "這些只是我的猜測，並沒有依據。但可以確定，這座雪山與杜林有著千絲萬縷的瓜葛。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100531
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100531,
					"content": "#而{F#妳}{M#你}手中這把劍的材料裡，應該就有杜林的殘骸。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100532
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100532,
					"content": "龍的殘骸？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100533
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100533,
					"content": "嗯。將死去的龍的眼睛、指甲、鱗片……磨成粉末塗抹到劍身上。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100534
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100534,
					"content": "這樣一來，杜林的污穢與毒便能融入劍中，成為劍的威力來源。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100535
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100535,
					"content": "這是非常高超的工藝，鐵匠在鑄劍成功後，一定會因為喜悅而親自試劍。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100536
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100536,
					"content": "只要他使用這把劍來戰鬥，劍上的污穢之力就會順著劍柄傳入他體內。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100537
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100537,
					"content": "常人無法抵抗這種力量，因詛咒而精神錯亂的鐵匠四處瘋逃，說不定，就在某處遭遇了不測。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100538
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100538,
					"content": "嗚哇…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100539
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100539,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100540
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412100540,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}淨化過特瓦林的淚滴，有著極為罕見的力量。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100541
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100541,
					"content": "#這份力量確保了{F#妳}{M#你}不僅不會被污穢和毒性腐蝕，還能徹底消除它們的危險性。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100542
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100542,
					"content": "#所以，只有{F#妳}{M#你}能好好地使用這把劍了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100543
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100543,
					"content": "話雖如此，這把劍果然還是太…呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100544
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100544,
					"content": "它、它好像在發光？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412100545
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412100545,
